        <property name="plainText">
         <string>Indicator Description:
If the closing price is higher than the opening price, the turnover is plotted as a red hollow candlestick; otherwise, it is plotted as a green solid candlestick.
MA1 and MA2 are the 5-day and 10-day moving averages of turnover, respectively.
(Parameters: MA1 and MA2 are typically set to 5 days and 10 days.)</string>
        </property>
